        <headline>Storm Warning issued September 25 at 2:58PM EDT until September 26 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Boston/Norton MA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 25 kt with gusts up to 50 kt and
waves around 3 feet.

* WHERE...In Massachusetts coastal waters, Boston Harbor. In
Rhode Island coastal waters, Narragansett Bay.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous waves will capsize
or damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should remain in port, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
